WEBVTT

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:11.300
Eastern Cooperative
Recreation School, since

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:14.740
1941, a place where fun
and laughter are cherished

00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:18.200
and nurtured, and where the spirit
of cooperative play is everywhere.

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:20.820
A place where you can experience yourself

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:23.240
through adventure and
discovery, and experience

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:24.820
others in a whole new way.

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:27.980
A place for singles and for families, for

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.000
young and old, to come
together in a supportive

00:00:30.220 --> 00:00:32.200
atmosphere of recreation and fun.

00:00:41.740 --> 00:00:44.820
Known as ECRS, the Eastern
Cooperative Recreation

00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:46.840
School runs six to
eight recreation events

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:51.220
each year, held in beautiful locations
throughout the eastern region of the U.S.

00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:54.700
Whether for a weekend or a
week, this is playtime for

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:57.780
adults, for children, for
singles, for families,

00:00:58.340 --> 00:01:00.320
for anyone who wants
to bring some fun back

00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:01.160
into their lives.

00:01:03.560 --> 00:01:09.100
I come for the laughter, and
the games, and the silliness.

00:01:09.540 --> 00:01:11.620
One time I remember I
stopped dancing, and

00:01:11.620 --> 00:01:14.380
I was telling them,
look at that, it really

00:01:14.380 --> 00:01:15.060
doesn't matter.

00:01:15.180 --> 00:01:16.920
They don't really care
if you're on your right

00:01:16.920 --> 00:01:19.320
foot or your left foot,
it isn't important.

00:01:20.160 --> 00:01:23.800
You just gotta keep going, that's all,
just keep moving, you're all right.

00:01:26.700 --> 00:01:30.120
ECRS is play, through
song, dance, and games,

00:01:30.740 --> 00:01:33.220
through puppetry, drama,
crafts, and storytelling.

00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:36.700
ECRS is the joy of
playing, and the shared

00:01:36.700 --> 00:01:38.900
community that comes
from joyful play, without

00:01:39.360 --> 00:01:42.100
regard to individual differences
or physical abilities.

00:01:42.960 --> 00:01:46.320
It is just so much fun
that you can't possibly

00:01:46.320 --> 00:01:50.020
imagine a bunch of people,
all different ages,

00:01:50.440 --> 00:01:51.260
playing together.

00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:54.680
Just laughing and having fun.

00:01:54.680 --> 00:01:59.260
And having so much fun that you can't
imagine it unless you come and experience it.

00:02:00.140 --> 00:02:02.120
At ECRS, we learn by doing.

00:02:02.880 --> 00:02:05.620
Anyone can lead a song,
play a game, explore

00:02:05.620 --> 00:02:08.520
the outdoors, act in a skit, learn a new

00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:13.160
dance, experience play in new ways, and
meet interesting people of all ages.

00:02:14.080 --> 00:02:14.960
I love it here.

00:02:15.380 --> 00:02:18.100
I love to sing and dance,
and the fellowship is

00:02:18.100 --> 00:02:19.680
the most wonderful thing,
a lot of interesting

00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:20.440
people here.

00:02:20.840 --> 00:02:24.140
I came here close to 25 years ago.

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:24.660
It's been a long time.

00:02:24.680 --> 00:02:27.430
It's been a long time since I've played at
ECRS, and at that time, it meant a place

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:29.260
for myself and my two children to come,

00:02:29.400 --> 00:02:32.340
where there were lots
of kids their own age.

00:02:34.060 --> 00:02:34.940
You're never too old to play.

00:02:35.780 --> 00:02:38.400
Play is for everyone,
and ECRS puts an emphasis

00:02:38.560 --> 00:02:40.700
on cooperation and respect for the unique

00:02:40.940 --> 00:02:42.260
contribution of each individual.

00:02:43.160 --> 00:02:44.020
Fun without competition.

00:02:44.840 --> 00:02:48.600
Everyone's a winner, each to their own
ability, and each at their own pace.

00:02:50.360 --> 00:02:54.340
You're going to find tremendous
amounts of support and friendship.

00:02:54.680 --> 00:02:58.120
And diversity, and
learning how to have fun,

00:02:58.300 --> 00:03:00.620
number one, that's the big thing for me.

00:03:00.820 --> 00:03:03.100
You think you've done it before, and then

00:03:03.100 --> 00:03:05.740
there's always much more
to come and experience

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:07.260
and much more to see.

00:03:08.700 --> 00:03:16.480
Classes include dancing, singing, games,
dramatics, crafts, music making, puppetry,

00:03:17.700 --> 00:03:23.620
storytelling, weaving, exploring outdoors
and leadership theory, or spend some time

00:03:23.620 --> 00:03:24.520
meeting new friends.

00:03:24.960 --> 00:03:28.620
Swimming or sledding, hiking,
or just enjoying quiet time.

00:03:29.280 --> 00:03:31.660
Our children's program
cleverly weaves all of

00:03:31.660 --> 00:03:33.860
these activities into an
exciting and wonderful

00:03:33.860 --> 00:03:36.380
learning experience
for your kids, who will

00:03:36.380 --> 00:03:38.520
delight in discovering
new talents they can

00:03:38.520 --> 00:03:39.740
share with their new friends.

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:40.800
Go to the pool.

00:03:41.080 --> 00:03:42.280
See all your friends.

00:03:43.060 --> 00:03:44.400
Games are fun for the kids, I feel.

00:03:44.920 --> 00:03:48.040
Dancing and singing and
playing games, running around.

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:54.120
ECRS also functions as a superb
learning and training opportunity for

00:03:54.560 --> 00:03:54.660
people with disabilities.

00:03:54.680 --> 00:03:57.300
Personal growth, and for
anyone in the recreation field.

00:03:58.240 --> 00:04:00.260
We have found that
recreation is important for

00:04:00.300 --> 00:04:02.560
its own sake, and is
valuable as a practical

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:05.360
tool for many vocations,
including teachers,

00:04:05.680 --> 00:04:08.000
community leaders, and
physical therapists.

00:04:09.280 --> 00:04:14.100
ECRS really has affected my
life in a very, very large way.

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:18.360
I was, I guess, basically
an introvert with

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:20.860
a lot of ideas and
afraid to use them, and

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:22.700
didn't have the guidance.

00:04:23.100 --> 00:04:24.460
And ECRS came along.

00:04:24.640 --> 00:04:28.040
And allowed me to have a comfortable type

00:04:28.140 --> 00:04:31.020
of atmosphere where I
could try things, not

00:04:31.020 --> 00:04:36.040
be laughed at, and use my creativity
that was all bottled up all of my life.

00:04:36.440 --> 00:04:38.620
And it's changed my entire career.

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:40.980
I had no idea of leading any dances.

00:04:41.580 --> 00:04:42.620
I just loved to folk dance.

00:04:43.410 --> 00:04:45.600
But some of us said in the class,
how about some practice teaching?

00:04:46.280 --> 00:04:47.340
All right, why not?

00:04:47.940 --> 00:04:49.000
I led a dance.

00:04:49.040 --> 00:04:50.320
That didn't seem so difficult.

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:51.250
It was a good experience.

00:04:51.580 --> 00:04:52.260
I led another one.

00:04:53.380 --> 00:04:54.440
And then soon I started
leading another one.

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:56.240
And then I started leading at parties
at home, which my friends would ask.

00:04:57.060 --> 00:04:58.920
But you don't have to
be an experienced or

00:04:58.920 --> 00:05:00.800
professional recreation leader to come to

00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:01.560
ECRS.

00:05:01.740 --> 00:05:04.180
All are welcome to join us as we practice

00:05:04.180 --> 00:05:06.320
and learn cooperative
leadership skills by

00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:09.120
experiencing the roles
of inviting, guiding,

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:11.120
and supporting others
in the play process.

00:05:11.960 --> 00:05:13.740
You will benefit from
evaluation and feedback,

00:05:14.340 --> 00:05:16.760
and if this is your
field of study, you can

00:05:16.760 --> 00:05:19.140
earn CEUs while having a wonderful time.

00:05:19.380 --> 00:05:20.760
People got into the rhythm.

00:05:21.240 --> 00:05:22.200
People enjoyed.

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:31.720
I've been encouraged to
tell a story tonight.

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:35.400
And for me, this is a big,
scary thing for me to do that.

00:05:35.940 --> 00:05:41.420
But I'm going to do it because I feel
supported by my instructor and by my group.

00:05:43.760 --> 00:05:48.100
And I'll probably make mistakes,
and I'm not really worried about it.

00:05:48.900 --> 00:05:53.040
Everyone is welcome from all walks of
life and of all backgrounds and ages.

00:05:53.250 --> 00:05:55.100
Come for a weekend or a week.

00:05:55.740 --> 00:05:56.120
Bring yourself.

00:05:56.740 --> 00:05:57.320
Bring your friends.

00:05:57.580 --> 00:05:58.500
Bring your family.

00:05:58.560 --> 00:06:00.800
For a drug and alcohol free experience to

00:06:00.820 --> 00:06:02.660
enrich your lives through
recreation and fun.

00:06:05.040 --> 00:06:07.140
I've been coming to ECRS
since I was 11 years

00:06:07.140 --> 00:06:09.340
old, and I won't tell
you how old I am now.

00:06:09.740 --> 00:06:10.500
I now bring my kids.

00:06:11.060 --> 00:06:14.220
Having come as a teenager
myself, the incredible

00:06:14.220 --> 00:06:16.680
feeling of bringing my
kid and bringing her

00:06:16.740 --> 00:06:23.020
here and watching her react and see all
the wonderful things that I saw as a kid.

00:06:23.020 --> 00:06:23.200
I've needed myself.

00:06:23.720 --> 00:06:24.620
It's just been wonderful.

00:06:25.700 --> 00:06:28.940
This is my first time at ECRS,
and it's been really fun.

00:06:29.080 --> 00:06:30.220
My grandparents took me here.

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:34.240
It's just like nothing,
nothing I've ever done before.

00:06:35.020 --> 00:06:39.760
At ECRS, it's okay to have fun,
even if you're not a little kid.

00:06:40.980 --> 00:06:43.460
Tuition is affordable, and
scholarships are available.

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:46.620
We are a nonprofit
accessible for people with

00:06:46.620 --> 00:06:49.300
disabilities and do not
discriminate by age,

00:06:49.500 --> 00:06:53.000
gender, race, religion, sexual
orientation, or ethnicity.

00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:53.600
ethnic origin.

00:06:55.980 --> 00:06:58.760
ECRS, the Eastern Cooperative
Recreation School,

00:06:59.140 --> 00:07:02.380
for some 60 years, a
place to celebrate life

00:07:02.380 --> 00:07:04.420
and its challenges
through recreational play,

00:07:04.600 --> 00:07:06.920
community values, and just plain old fun.

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:11.240
Play more, live longer, ECRS.

00:07:43.640 --> 00:07:43.920
Subtitles by the Amara.org community
